anterade saken.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\"><strong>Teresa</strong><span>Recension p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"4 av 5 stj&#228;rnor\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"off\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span></div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;439 kr inklusive frakt f&#246;r 330 ml parfym. Inte illa.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>V&#228;ldigt bra pris, 380 kr f&#246;r 6 styck 50 ml parfymflaskor och fick &#228;ven med en gratis mysteryflaska i 30 ml.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\"><strong>Sadek Abduljalil</strong><span>Recension p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"5 av 5 stj&#228;rnor\"><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span><span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2.5l2.9 6.6 7.1.6-5.4 4.7 1.6 7-6.2-3.7-6.2 3.7 1.6-7L2 9.7l7.1-.6z\"/></svg></span></div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/tryscent.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot-recension</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8221;Mycket n&#246;jd med hur de doftar.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Har nu f&#229;tt mina varor. Det var v&#228;l paketerat och fick bra information kring hur det gick med leveransen.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\"><strong>Christian Edvardsson</strong><span>Recension p&#229; Trustpilot</span></div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"nav\">\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"arrow\" data-ts-prev aria-label=\"F&#246;reg&#229;ende recension\">&#8249;</button>\n      <div class=\"dots\" data-ts-dots></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"arrow\" data-ts-next aria-label=\"N&#228;sta recension\">&#8250;</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var roots = document.querySelectorAll('.ts-proof-sv');\n  Array.prototype.forEach.call(roots, function(root){\n    var track = root.querySelector('[data-ts-carousel]');\n    var dotsWrap = root.querySelector('[data-ts-dots]');\n    var prev = root.querySelector('[data-ts-prev]');\n    var next = root.querySelector('[data-ts-next]');\n    if (!track || !dotsWrap || !prev || !next) return;\n    var cards = Array.prototype.slice.call(track.children);\n    if (!cards.length) return;\n\n    function step(){ return cards.length > 1 ? cards[1].offsetLeft - cards[0].offsetLeft : track.clientWidth; }\n    function positions(){ return Math.max(1, cards.length - Math.round(track.clientWidth / step()) + 1); }\n    function current(){\n      var max = track.scrollWidth - track.clientWidth;\n      if (track.scrollLeft >= max - 2) return positions() - 1;\n      return Math.round(track.scrollLeft / step());\n    }\n    function go(i){ track.scrollTo({left: i * step(), behavior: 'smooth'}); }\n\n    function buildDots(){\n      dotsWrap.innerHTML = '';\n      for (var i = 0; i < positions(); i++) {\n        var d = document.createElement('button');\n        d.type = 'button';\n        d.className = 'dot';\n        d.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Recension ' + (i + 1));\n        d.addEventListener('click', go.bind(null, i));\n        dotsWrap.appendChild(d);\n      }\n      update();\n    }\n    function update(){\n      var c = current(), n = positions();\n      Array.prototype.forEach.call(dotsWrap.children, function(d, i){ d.classList.toggle('active', i === c); });\n      prev.disabled = c <= 0;\n      next.disabled = c >= n - 1;\n    }\n\n    prev.addEventListener('click', function(){ go(Math.max(0, current() - 1)); });\n    next.addEventListener('click', function(){ go(Math.min(positions() - 1, current() + 1)); });\n    var t;\n    track.addEventListener('scroll', function(){ clearTimeout(t); t = setTimeout(update, 60); });\n    window.addEventListener('resize', buildDots);\n    buildDots();\n  });\n})();\n</script>",
